{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_adr_0206_a_sets_page_one_menu_a_pinned_timeline_decision", "label": "ADR 0206: Give the set's page one round menu per song and a pinned timeline; give the site's ground some depth", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0206-a-sets-page-one-menu-a-pinned-timeline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The user (2026-11-27) asked for a faint grid behind the lanes so lining up is easier, one round menu holding everything about a song, a bass strip that grows under the pointer with a x per stretch, zoom no further out than the whole set, the transport and timeline pinned at the top, a part of the set exported, the tracklist in a modal, and a background with some depth. Rejected: a full pie menu with sub-rings (seven styles and four bass choices do not fit a ring legibly; the hand-over box opened beside the ring keeps them readable); an image for the background (lines drawn in CSS from the theme's tokens: no asset, right in every theme)."}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_adr_0206_a_sets_page_one_menu_a_pinned_timeline_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0206-a-sets-page-one-menu-a-pinned-timeline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0206_a_sets_page_one_menu_a_pinned_timeline_decision", "target": "src_ui_sets_setlanes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0206-a-sets-page-one-menu-a-pinned-timeline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0206_a_sets_page_one_menu_a_pinned_timeline_decision", "target": "src_ui_sets_setview", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0206-a-sets-page-one-menu-a-pinned-timeline.md", "